      "side": 1,
      "message": "I fully expected the specific error messages to change from run-to-run, because the starting function depends on the iteration order of unordered_map (and I\u0027m using pointers as the keys!). And yet, after a couple different builds, even unix -\u003e windows, I haven\u0027t seen the golden files change. Am I being overly nervous? This output can\u0027t possibly be stable, right?",
